00:18:51.526 --> 00:18:53.070
Jangan nakal.

00:18:59.785 --> 00:19:04.456
-Kebetulan, kalian berdua pernah berciuman?
-Berhenti berkata seperti itu di depan anak kecil.

00:19:06.208 --> 00:19:08.210
Waktunya tidur, Beom. Sudah malam.

00:19:09.044 --> 00:19:10.462
-Mi-seon.
-Ya?

00:19:10.545 --> 00:19:12.839
